ge from 2 to 100 depending on the game.\n\nGames include board games such as Chess, Checkers, Connect Four and Battleships; word and guessing games such as Hangman and Spectrum; and social games such as Cards vs Room, Jury Duty and Burn or Bot.", "themes": [{"id": 40, "name": "Party"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/blamechat", "videos": [{"id": 195217, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "tQriKP17CeA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tQriKP17CeA", "title": "BlameChat Gameplay", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tQriKP17CeA/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}